{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>Altar.</b> Of many stones." "<b>Pillar.</b> Of a single stone — and it is בִּימוּס, as it is called in the Mishnah (Avodah Zarah 47): a stone quarried from its outset for a בִּימוּס." "<b>Asherah.</b> A tree that is worshipped." "<b>And you shall destroy their name.</b> By giving them a name of disgrace — Beit Galia, they call Beit Karya; Ein Kol, [they call] Ein Kotz (ibid. 36)."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:46:42.068480268Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}